    "### **random row**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "1cdf2775",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df.sample(2) #selects two random rows."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6d44b923",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### **using `query()`**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "d23287b5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df[df[\"Marks\"] > 85]\n",
    "df.query(\"Marks > 85\")\n",
    "df.query(\"Age > 23 and Marks > 85\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c647df47",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### **Index label**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "181b050c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df.index = [\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\", \"E\"]\n",
    "# then use \n",
    "df.loc[\"B\"]"
   ]
  }
